    },
    {
      "id": "fq6vam8",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Ramsar Sites in J&amp;K: Hokkersar Wetland (Srinagar), Surinsar-Mansar Lakes (Jammu), Wular Lake (Bandipora), Hygam Wetland, Shallabug Wetland",
        "Ramsar Sites in Ladakh: Tso Moriri &amp; Tsomur (2002), Tso Kar Wetland Complex (2020)",
        "Project Snow Leopard: Govt of India; conservation of snow leopard and its habitat; major coverage in Ladakh &amp; J&amp;K",
        "Project Hangul: Conservation of Kashmiri stag (Hangul) in Dachigam NP",
        "Bio-diversity Hotspot: Western Himalayas (including J&amp;K) is one of 4 biodiversity hotspots in India",
        "Frozen Zoo: CSIR-IIIM Jammu and Forest Research Institute preserving genetic material of rare J&amp;K flora"
      ]
    },
